('u5_11_breathtaking_5_meaning','vocab_breathtaking_5','u5_11_breathtaking_5','breathtaking_5_1','meaning_context','Visitors fell silent when the clouds cleared and revealed the breathtaking view from the summit.',null,'["awe-inspiring"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_11_breathtaking_5_paraphrase','vocab_breathtaking_5','u5_11_breathtaking_5','breathtaking_5_1','paraphrase_context','Visitors fell silent when the clouds cleared and revealed the awe-inspiring view from the summit.','awe-inspiring','["breathtaking"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_11_breathtaking_5_production','vocab_breathtaking_5','u5_11_breathtaking_5','breathtaking_5_1','production_context','Travel writers often describe the lagoon as astonishingly beautiful at dawn.','astonishingly beautiful','["breathtaking"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_11_breathtaking_5_gap_1','vocab_breathtaking_5','u5_11_breathtaking_5','breathtaking_5_1','gap_fill','Standing on the glass platform above the gorge was a breathtaking experience, and several visitors needed a moment to recover.','breathtaking','["breathtaking"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_11_breathtaking_5_gap_2','vocab_breathtaking_5','u5_11_breathtaking_5','breathtaking_5_1','gap_fill','Even experienced travellers admit that the first sight of the ancient city at sunrise is breathtaking.','breathtaking','["breathtaking"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_11_breathtaking_5_gap_3','vocab_breathtaking_5','u5_11_breathtaking_5','breathtaking_5_1','gap_fill','The documentary ends with a breathtaking shot of whales leaping out of the water at sunset.','breathtaking','["breathtaking"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_12_spectacular_meaning','vocab_spectacular','u5_12_spectacular','spectacular_1','meaning_context','The firework display over the harbour was spectacular, with colour filling the sky for twenty minutes.',null,'["grand and striking"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_12_spectacular_paraphrase','vocab_spectacular','u5_12_spectacular','spectacular_1','paraphrase_context','The firework display over the harbour was grand and striking, with colour filling the sky for twenty minutes.','grand and striking','["spectacular"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_12_spectacular_production','vocab_spectacular','u5_12_spectacular','spectacular_1','production_context','The opening ceremony was impressive on a large scale, with hundreds of dancers and a choir of two hundred voices.','impressive on a large scale','["spectacular"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_12_spectacular_gap_1','vocab_spectacular','u5_12_spectacular','spectacular_1','gap_fill','The carnival procession through the old town was a spectacular event, with huge floats, live music and thousands of dancers.','spectacular','["spectacular"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_12_spectacular_gap_2','vocab_spectacular','u5_12_spectacular','spectacular_1','gap_fill','The waterfall drops over a hundred metres into the gorge, and the spray makes a spectacular sight from the viewing platform.','spectacular','["spectacular"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_12_spectacular_gap_3','vocab_spectacular','u5_12_spectacular','spectacular_1','gap_fill','Tourists gather every evening to watch the spectacular sunset show, when hundreds of birds fill the sky above the lake.','spectacular','["spectacular"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_13_dramatic_meaning','vocab_dramatic','u5_13_dramatic','dramatic_1','meaning_context','The dramatic coastline of the island has steep cliffs that fall straight into the sea.',null,'["striking and powerful"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_13_dramatic_paraphrase','vocab_dramatic','u5_13_dramatic','dramatic_1','paraphrase_context','The striking and powerful coastline of the island has steep cliffs that fall straight into the sea.','striking and powerful','["dramatic"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_13_dramatic_production','vocab_dramatic','u5_13_dramatic','dramatic_1','production_context','Visitors were surprised by the sudden and sharp drop in temperature when the sun went down.','sudden and sharp','["dramatic"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_13_dramatic_gap_1','vocab_dramatic','u5_13_dramatic','dramatic_1','gap_fill','Photographers love the dramatic skies over the bay, where black storm clouds and bright sunlight appear together.','dramatic','["dramatic"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_13_dramatic_gap_2','vocab_dramatic','u5_13_dramatic','dramatic_1','gap_fill','After the new hotel opened, there was a dramatic increase in the number of visitors, from two thousand to twenty thousand a year.','dramatic','["dramatic"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_13_dramatic_gap_3','vocab_dramatic','u5_13_dramatic','dramatic_1','gap_fill','The boat trip had one dramatic moment, when a huge whale leapt out of the water beside us.','dramatic','["dramatic"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_14_stunning_meaning','vocab_stunning','u5_14_stunning','stunning_1','meaning_context','The hotel offers stunning views of the bay from every room.',null,'["extremely attractive"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_14_stunning_paraphrase','vocab_stunning','u5_14_stunning','stunning_1','paraphrase_context','The hotel offers extremely attractive views of the bay from every room.','extremely attractive','["stunning"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_14_stunning_production','vocab_stunning','u5_14_stunning','stunning_1','production_context','Many guests say that the lagoon looks strikingly beautiful at dawn.','strikingly beautiful','["stunning"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_14_stunning_gap_1','vocab_stunning','u5_14_stunning','stunning_1','gap_fill','The resort’s stunning beach, with its white sand and clear blue water, appears on posters all over the city.','stunning','["stunning"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_14_stunning_gap_2','vocab_stunning','u5_14_stunning','stunning_1','gap_fill','The photographs of the lagoon were so stunning that the magazine used one on its front cover.','stunning','["stunning"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_14_stunning_gap_3','vocab_stunning','u5_14_stunning','stunning_1','gap_fill','With its stunning mountain backdrop and its sparkling lake, the wedding venue is booked two years in advance.','stunning','["stunning"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_15_popular_meaning','vocab_popular','u5_15_popular','popular_1','meaning_context','Tropical islands are popular destinations for honeymoon couples.',null,'["well-liked"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_15_popular_paraphrase','vocab_popular','u5_15_popular','popular_1','paraphrase_context','Tropical islands are well-liked destinations for honeymoon couples.','well-liked','["popular"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_15_popular_production','vocab_popular','u5_15_popular','popular_1','production_context','The old fishing village remains favoured by many people looking for a quiet weekend away.','favoured by many people','["popular"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_15_popular_gap_1','vocab_popular','u5_15_popular','popular_1','gap_fill','In summer, the coastal path is so popular that walkers sometimes have to queue to cross the narrow bridges.','popular','["popular"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_15_popular_gap_2','vocab_popular','u5_15_popular','popular_1','gap_fill','The beach café is popular with local families, and every table is taken by noon.','popular','["popular"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_15_popular_gap_3','vocab_popular','u5_15_popular','popular_1','gap_fill','Hiking has become one of the most popular activities in the national park, because it is cheap, healthy and open to everyone.','popular','["popular"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_16_static_meaning','vocab_static','u5_16_static','static_1','meaning_context','The film-maker used a static camera, so the picture of the harbour stayed the same from start to finish.',null,'["fixed"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_16_static_paraphrase','vocab_static','u5_16_static','static_1','paraphrase_context','The film-maker used a fixed camera, so the picture of the harbour stayed the same from start to finish.','fixed','["static"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_16_static_production','vocab_static','u5_16_static','static_1','production_context','For the long exposure, she kept the camera perfectly motionless on a tripod.','motionless','["static"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_16_static_gap_1','vocab_static','u5_16_static','static_1','gap_fill','The wildlife film uses a static camera, fixed to a post beside the waterhole, to record the animals for months.','static','["static"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_16_static_gap_2','vocab_static','u5_16_static','static_1','gap_fill','Tourist numbers stayed static for five years, neither rising nor falling.','static','["static"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_16_static_gap_3','vocab_static','u5_16_static','static_1','gap_fill','Many British families spend summer weekends in a static caravan on the coast, which stays on the same site all year.','static','["static"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_17_ground_level_meaning','vocab_ground_level','u5_17_ground_level','ground_level_1','meaning_context','Most of the pictures in the guidebook are ground-level, unlike the drone shots on the website.',null,'["taken from low down"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_17_ground_level_paraphrase','vocab_ground_level','u5_17_ground_level','ground_level_1','paraphrase_context','Most of the pictures in the guidebook are taken from low down, unlike the drone shots on the website.','taken from low down','["ground-level"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_17_ground_level_production','vocab_ground_level','u5_17_ground_level','ground_level_1','production_context','Her best photographs were shot from a low position, which made the old walls look tall and strong.','shot from a low position','["ground-level"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_17_ground_level_gap_1','vocab_ground_level','u5_17_ground_level','ground_level_1','gap_fill','The drone pictures are impressive, but the ground-level photographs show what a visitor really sees when walking through the gate.','ground-level','["ground-level"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_17_ground_level_gap_2','vocab_ground_level','u5_17_ground_level','ground_level_1','gap_fill','From this ground-level viewpoint, the old city walls look enormous, but from the air they seem low and thin.','ground-level','["ground-level"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_17_ground_level_gap_3','vocab_ground_level','u5_17_ground_level','ground_level_1','gap_fill','Beginners are advised to take ground-level shots first, standing on the path, before trying to photograph the valley from the cable car.','ground-level','["ground-level"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_18_angle_of_view_meaning','vocab_angle_of_view','u5_18_angle_of_view','angle_of_view_1','meaning_context','A wide angle of view lets the photographer fit the whole bay, the harbour and the mountains into a single picture.',null,'["field of vision"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_18_angle_of_view_paraphrase','vocab_angle_of_view','u5_18_angle_of_view','angle_of_view_1','paraphrase_context','A wide field of vision lets the photographer fit the whole bay, the harbour and the mountains into a single picture.','field of vision','["angle of view"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_18_angle_of_view_production','vocab_angle_of_view','u5_18_angle_of_view','angle_of_view_1','production_context','Tourists with phones often forget that every lens affects the width of the scene captured.','width of the scene captured','["angle of view"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_18_angle_of_view_gap_1','vocab_angle_of_view','u5_18_angle_of_view','angle_of_view_1','gap_fill','To fit the whole mountain range into one picture, she switched to a lens with a much wider angle of view.','angle of view','["angle of view"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_18_angle_of_view_gap_2','vocab_angle_of_view','u5_18_angle_of_view','angle_of_view_1','gap_fill','A photographer chooses the angle of view according to how much of the scene he wants in the picture.','angle of view','["angle of view"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_18_angle_of_view_gap_3','vocab_angle_of_view','u5_18_angle_of_view','angle_of_view_1','gap_fill','The lens on the drone gives an angle of view of almost ninety degrees, so each photograph includes the entire beach.','angle of view','["angle of view"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_19_ecological_habitats_meaning','vocab_ecological_habitats','u5_19_ecological_habitats','ecological_habitats_1','meaning_context','Careless tourism can damage fragile ecological habitats such as wetlands and coral reefs.',null,'["natural homes of wildlife"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_19_ecological_habitats_paraphrase','vocab_ecological_habitats','u5_19_ecological_habitats','ecological_habitats_1','paraphrase_context','Careless tourism can damage fragile natural homes of wildlife such as wetlands and coral reefs.','natural homes of wildlife','["ecological habitats"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_19_ecological_habitats_production','vocab_ecological_habitats','u5_19_ecological_habitats','ecological_habitats_1','production_context','Protected areas safeguard environments that support living things, from insects to large mammals.','environments that support living things','["ecological habitats"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_19_ecological_habitats_gap_1','vocab_ecological_habitats','u5_19_ecological_habitats','ecological_habitats_1','gap_fill','The reserve was created to protect rare ecological habitats, such as peat bogs and ancient woodland, from the effects of tourism.','ecological habitats','["ecological habitats"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_19_ecological_habitats_gap_2','vocab_ecological_habitats','u5_19_ecological_habitats','ecological_habitats_1','gap_fill','Scientists warn that building new resorts on the coast will destroy the ecological habitats on which turtles and seabirds depend.','ecological habitats','["ecological habitats"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_19_ecological_habitats_gap_3','vocab_ecological_habitats','u5_19_ecological_habitats','ecological_habitats_1','gap_fill','The guide stopped the group at the edge of the wetland and explained how the different ecological habitats support each other.','ecological habitats','["ecological habitats"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_20_marine_world_meaning','vocab_marine_world','u5_20_marine_world','marine_world_1','meaning_context','The aquarium takes children on a journey through the marine world.',null,'["life beneath the waves"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_20_marine_world_paraphrase','vocab_marine_world','u5_20_marine_world','marine_world_1','paraphrase_context','The aquarium takes children on a journey through life beneath the waves.','life beneath the waves','["marine world"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_20_marine_world_production','vocab_marine_world','u5_20_marine_world','marine_world_1','production_context','This programme introduces young viewers to the ocean and its creatures.','the ocean and its creatures','["marine world"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_20_marine_world_gap_1','vocab_marine_world','u5_20_marine_world','marine_world_1','gap_fill','The documentary invites viewers to explore the marine world, from tiny plankton to the largest whales.','marine world','["marine world"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_20_marine_world_gap_2','vocab_marine_world','u5_20_marine_world','marine_world_1','gap_fill','Snorkellers at the reef can see colourful fish, turtles and rays, and many return home fascinated by the marine world.','marine world','["marine world"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_20_marine_world_gap_3','vocab_marine_world','u5_20_marine_world','marine_world_1','gap_fill','Children at the seaside centre learn to protect the marine world by collecting plastic from the beach.','marine world','["marine world"]'::jsonb,null,'live')
